        "type": "object",
        "title": "ResearchOptions",
        "description": "Opt-in research enrichment for forecasting requests.\n\nWhen set, the API fetches web-grounded context from the requested sources\nand injects it into the prompt before calling the model. Each successful\nsource produces a billable RESEARCH event."
      },
